<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Jujutsu Shenanigans Roblox</Major>
    <Description>Requirements:
- at least 120 FPS ingame
- no higher than a 20 ping in public servers
- use the 'Vessel' Character

Info:
- Automatically does a so called 'Blackflash Chain' in the Roblox game Jujutsu Shenanigans
- Easiest way to do a 'Blackflash Chain' which isnt banable.

What to do:
- Once you see that it makes the dash animation, swiftly flick your mouse while using shiftlock so you look in the other direction and can continue the Chain.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 32 1
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 120 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
